WEBVTT

NOTE Timings aligned locally from the source audio.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:26.683
(bouncing) O. o. Ah, Ah, Ah.

2
00:00:26.683 --> 00:00:53.367
Ah, Octopus! (bouncing) (gentle piano music) Ah.

3
00:00:53.367 --> 00:01:20.050
Ah, Ostrich. (squelch) Ah.

4
00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:22.610
Ah, On! (click) Ah, Off! (click) Ah.

5
00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:28.350
Lowercase o. Lowercase h. (water splashing)

6
00:01:28.350 --> 00:02:18.310
Hhh. (ding) (water splashes) Ah. (ding) (water splashes) Repeat (x3)

7
00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:24.110
Outstanding! (water splashes) Yahoo! (water splashes)

8
00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:29.630
Ah. Goodbye.

9
00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:31.151
THE END
